    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d300">

                <pb facs="0322" n="310" sameAs="frus:frus1939v01/pg310"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">741.61/856: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Steinhardt</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-08-25T22:00:00+03:00">August 25, 1939—10
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received August 25—3:32 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>473. The French and British military missions after seeing Voroshilov this
                    afternoon are definitely leaving for Finland tonight.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Steinhardt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
